---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Section id="about" eyebrow="About" title="Hi, I'm Kayla">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] lg:gap-16">
    <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/80">
      <p>
        I bake out of my own kitchen here in {site.city}, which means every order
        gets made one at a time, by me. No production line, no case of leftovers
        from yesterday — just the cake you asked for, on the day you need it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started because I liked making my kids' birthday cakes more than I
        liked buying them. That hasn't really changed. The best part of this is
        still watching somebody's face when they see the thing they described to
        me actually sitting on the table.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have an idea, send it over. If you have half an idea, send that
        too — most of my favorite cakes started as a blurry photo and a "can you
        do something like this?"
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="rounded-card border border-mint-300/70 bg-mint-100 p-7">
      <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-mint-800 uppercase">
        Good to know
      </h3>
      <dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Cottage food operation</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-ink/75">
            {site.name} is a Florida cottage food operation, which means Kayla
            sells directly to you from her own home kitchen.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Where</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-ink/75">{site.serviceArea}</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Getting in touch</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-ink/75">
            <a class="text-mint-800 underline underline-offset-2" href={site.phoneHref}>
              Text {site.phone}
            </a>
            {' '}or{' '}
            <a class="text-mint-800 underline underline-offset-2" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
              email
            </a>.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-5 border-t border-mint-300 pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/65">
        {site.cottageDisclosure}
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>
